<title>POLAND: ELEKTROMONTAZ OCT SWINGS TO LOSS IN OCT.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROMONTAZ OCT SWINGS TO LOSS IN OCT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.02 vs   0.18 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.03 vs   0.19</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.12 vs   0.21 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    2.30 vs   2.50</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.75 vs   0.02</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.12 vs   0.11</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.02 vs   1.04 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   36.20 vs  19.79</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction firm is</p>
<p>Elektromontaz Export SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
